{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_05_end","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-5","storyName":"三岔路口","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"纳乔向克莱门莎直言，想用奥卢斯的情报换所有岛民的命。港都中心城区打捞在即，斐戴拉重新安排船厂工作，德·托莱多想点亮海图。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_05_end","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["惩戒军士官","克莱门莎","？？？","塔西塔","纳乔","斐戴拉","洒脱的船工","萨尔瓦多","特菲","瓦列里奥","惩戒军士兵","德鲁莎","南多","小帮手"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"克莱门莎监事，审判庭已经确认了您的申请，您可以审问岛民纳乔了。","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"谢谢。","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"等等！","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我知道你会跟过来，塔西塔。","id":17},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"克莱门莎监事。","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"如果你担心，我可以向你保证，我会严格遵守我在打捞港都的计划书中提到的介入原则。","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"事实上，我现在正在按照伊比利亚的方式处理纳乔的问题。","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#8$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"克莱门莎监事，无论您如何保证，我依然会为阿戈尔的权益担忧，您无法说服我。","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#11$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"但我也思考了您所说的一切，只要有怀疑，我都可以去验证和解决。","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"是的。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"我想旁听这场审问，克莱门莎监事。","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#2$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"我想切切实实地去了解您如此在乎，甚至愿意为之冒险的岛民，我们陆上的同胞，究竟是怎样的人。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我明白了。","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"士官，我是否能增加一名随行的记录员进入地牢呢？","id":41},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":42},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$blooddrop","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":49},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"抱歉，审问可以尽快开始吗？有些岛民同胞伤得很重，他们需要得到正规的医疗救助，而且——","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"什么？","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"不，没什么。","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"申请跟你谈话的资格费了一些时间，我必须尊重伊比利亚的流程。","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"请进，克莱门莎监事，我会回避。","id":64},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":67},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","duration":"1.2","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1","duration":"1.2","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":73,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"克莱门莎监事，塔西塔小姐？","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"塔西塔会全程记录我们的对话，而我会负责对你的审问。","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我以为来的会是一名伊比利亚的审判官。","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你对着惩戒军都表现得有口难言，如果出现在这里的是审判官，你还能说出自己真正的想法吗？","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"您一直在观察我？","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我只是善于认出需要帮助的人。","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你和你的同胞遇到麻烦了，对吗？","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"从作为岛民降生开始，我们就遇到“麻烦”了。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"只是这次，阿奎拉被捕和她的死，让我不得不重新面对这些“麻烦”。","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"参与灯塔袭击的岛民有一些是我的同事或朋友，所以我很清楚，在被定义为袭击者之前他们曾做过什么。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"他们曾给废弃的城镇通上电，在干涸的土地上挖水井，去培育能适应盐碱地的庄稼……","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"他们想证明自己有活在这片土地上的价值，有活在这片土地上的资格，但最后选择的方式是毁掉自己和祖辈亲手创造的事物。","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"当初的灯塔就是由岛民亲手设计的，而现在港都的三十七座灯塔，也确实都是由岛民亲手修建的。","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"如果大家都能像您这样，哪怕在他们犯了错之后，也还记得他们做过的贡献就好了。或许这样，今天的一切就都不会发生。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"但我出现在这里，就证明事情已经发展到很糟糕的地步了。","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你跟之前有些不一样了。","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"加入互助会的这几天，我总在思考阿奎拉的做法，甚至鲁菲纳奶奶当初的做法。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我曾经远离互助会，是因为我认为散播仇恨是错的，害我丢了一条手臂的恶性循环是错的。","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"但最终我得出的结论是，我其实并没有那么在意她们的做法是对是错。","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"在失去鲁菲纳奶奶，失去阿奎拉这个朋友之后，我脑子里只有一件事——我不希望因为积怨再失去任何岛民同胞。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"纳乔……","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"这是某种心理上的逃避也罢，是名为自私的道德缺陷也罢，我无法违背我的感受。","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"比起审判庭的长官，比起对岛民神色冷峻的伊比利亚人，我就是更能理解岛民同胞的心情，这条残缺的手臂时时刻刻在提醒我这一点。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"直到这刻我才明白，我并不是因为同胞们的戾气远离互助会，而是害怕自己成为另一个鲁菲纳奶奶，害怕自己伤害对自己而言重要的人。","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"但现在我没有任何可以失去的东西了。我会为了同胞向一切我可以接触到的人寻求一条出路——只要他不伤害我的朋友们。","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我明白了，说出你的诉求，纳乔。","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我知道互助会的组织者，阿奎拉的“导师”是谁，我亲眼目睹过，也几乎可以肯定他的目的不只是帮助岛民袭击灯塔。","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我想用他的情报，换所有岛民的命。","id":129},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":130},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"charslot","id":134},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":136},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":139},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":140},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":141,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"1","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","posfrom":"-240,-50","posto":"-150,-50","duration":"3.5","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"1","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","posfrom":"50,-50","posto":"-80,-50","duration":"3.5","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"1","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","posfrom":"-80,-50","posto":"180,-50","duration":"2","focus":"m","block":"false","id":145},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-50","duration":"5","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","afrom":"0","ato":"1","posfrom":"130,-50","posto":"50,-50","duration":"1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"肃静——","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":157},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":159},{"type":"charslot","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"造船厂的全体工人，前几日的袭击事件想必各位都有耳闻，但请放心，审判庭已经逮捕了袭击者，打捞计划也不会受到影响。","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你们将有机会承担起更加荣耀的工作，而非只是清扫海面或是修理旧船。","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"从今天起，你们只会有一个共同的目标——为几天后港都中心城区的打捞工作保驾护航，让雷亚-伊比利亚重新成为大地的海港。","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"现在，我会重新给每个人分派任务。","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"阿比利奥，带领你的组员重新检查水下廊道沿线的起重机；布尔莎、埃尔比奥，让你们的小组去三号船坞报到。","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"打捞当天，伊比利亚的海图会时隔六十三年重新出现在外围城区的广场上，所有住民都能看到雷亚-伊比利亚黯淡的坐标重新亮起。","id":167},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"50","duration":"1.5","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"海图？我们终于能看到以前的伊比利亚到底有多少城市，它们又都在哪里了？","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"进船厂之前我可没想过自己还能见到这个……萨尔瓦多，我们也算是能亲手把港都带回伊比利亚了呀。","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"住口，不要忘了我们为什么在这里。","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"我们领受圣徒的照拂，遵从他的意志，我们所做的一切是为了向伊比利亚德行的化身证明自己的洁净。","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"我们本应该付出甚至消耗自身，我们无需过问圣洁者决定的来由，也无需用说辞奖赏自己。","id":179},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#13$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"……","id":184},{"type":"dialog","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":187},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"charslot","id":190},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":191},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"特菲，你怎么现在才回来？大审判官阁下正要找你问罪——","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"……","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#6$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"你怎么了？","id":200},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act26side/m_avg_cledub_sad.mp3","volume":"0","id":201,"musicid":3},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"船厂封锁的时候我发现萨尔瓦多不见了，就出去找。他被一个岛民堵在巷子里，手里拿着念珠。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我这才想起来他早上在船厂突然朝教堂的方向祈祷，我们劝说他，他也不听。他从船厂离开应该就是为了回家取这样东西。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#14$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"那个堵着他的岛民手里拿着捕鳞钩，一脸凶相，萨尔瓦多的眼睛只顾盯着自己的念珠，丝毫没有顾及眼前的危险。","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我知道，如果我没有出现，他一定会死……为了他的信仰而死。","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#5$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"……","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#14$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"可我也知道，他最初相信那些，就只是因为救济他的那个教士正要从教袍里给他拿食物的时候，他恰好打了个喷嚏。","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#14$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"等他睁开眼，教士手里已经多了一块无酵饼。他以为教士能凭空变出吃的来，就那么稀里糊涂地成了信徒。","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"可现在，他却愿意为了那信仰去死？","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我不能再看他盲信下去，圣徒阁下离他那么远，怎么会听见他的祈祷声？","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#6$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"如果他相信的是德·托莱多大人，哪怕我只是个骗子，我至少可以盯着他不犯傻，可以救下他啊！","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"但我要怎么做……","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"特菲，雕像、军装、佩刀、法杖，还有你的故事之所以会奏效，是因为人们愿意相信新奇的、有趣的东西。","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"是啊，在伊比利亚谁愿意相信一个没有权势、没有财富、没有能力的小人物呢？","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#13$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"那就去成为“大人物”。","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#15$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"什么？","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"就算只是做一件万众瞩目的事，也可以证明你不是口说无凭，或许他会相信你。","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#15$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"……","id":236},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":237},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":243},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":244},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#13$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"……","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"萨尔瓦多，如果我向你证明，我能成为那个点亮海图的人呢？","id":251},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":252,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#10$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"你愿意扔掉所有曾经相信过的东西，加入我的海军舰队，相信我吗？","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"你在说什么天方夜谭……","id":256},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-50","duration":"1.5","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"安静！我会亲自负责海图系统的所有操作，在打捞庆典上点亮——","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"等等！斐戴拉大审判官，请让我来启动海图，点亮雷亚-伊比利亚的坐标！","id":264},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","focus":"l","duration":"1","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"什……","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"违抗命令，擅自外出，扰乱公共秩序，阻碍审判庭公务，还需要我报更多罪名吗？","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"如果不是我仁慈，你此刻应该已经身在牢狱之中。","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"但为了打捞顺利进行，您正缺人手不是吗？","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"船厂缺少的是打捞的船工，不是一时兴起的看客，启动海图可不是按一个按钮的事。","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我知道。","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你知道？","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"在石涛镇，我有一个拥护者的祖辈曾在雷亚-伊比利亚供职。","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"他说有一幅黄金的海图会铺满外围城区广场的天空，每一个路人都能看到伊比利亚的版图，并为此骄傲。","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"大静谧之后，伊比利亚的国土支离破碎，没有人再记得这片土地上曾经建立过多少城市，而水底下又沉睡着多少。","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"但我知道。","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我走遍伊比利亚的角角落落，我跟窃贼、流浪汉、证裁官，甚至贵族的后裔侃侃而谈，我用脑子记下了伊比利亚曾经拥有的每一寸土地。","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"大审判官阁下，如果整个伊比利亚除了您之外还有一个人能读懂海图，明白它的操作方式，那只能是我。","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"荒谬。就算你向我证明你了解伊比利亚的每一颗沙砾，我依然不会将这份工作交给你。","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"走吧，别让自己罪加一等。","id":300},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我——","id":304},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"charslot","id":306},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"……","id":313},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你们回去巡逻吧，切记，不能让任何闲杂人等靠近中控室，那是整个港都的心脏。","id":320},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"是！","id":325},{"type":"dialog","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"点亮海图……她根本不知道那个光点意味着什么，更不知道审判庭要付出什么，就连我也……","id":333},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"谁在那里！","id":340},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"charslot","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"抱歉，大审判官阁下，是我。","id":345},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"charslot","id":349},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":354,"musicid":5},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#10$1","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"呃——","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"10,0","duration":"0.5","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"嘶——","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#6$1","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"*伊比利亚粗口*……就杀了一屋子的恐鱼，尸体都不够没过脚踝的，怎么就能伤到连自己拿个苹果都不行了……","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"当年我可是——啧。","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#6$1","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"南多！！！","id":370},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#3$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","id":373},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"教官，我在！怎么了？","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#7$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"南多，是谁教你把苹果削成这么好看又好拿的小鼷兽形状的？","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#2$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"报告教官，是我姐姐！您喜欢的话，她也会高兴的，需要我继续削吗？","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"她就没教过你，这么贴心地削完之后，至少应该放在病人能够得着的地方吗？","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#5$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"抱歉教官，我没想到您伤到连起身也做不到，我这就递给——","id":383},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_higheldshosfts","volume":"1","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我来吧。","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#1$1","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"克莱门莎监事！","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#3$1","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"不打扰两位谈话了，我先回岗哨。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#3$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"1","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":397},{"type":"charslot","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":399},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_higheldshosfts","volume":"1","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","posfrom":"180,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":402},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_putapple","volume":"1","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"亲自慰问？我听说有个岛民投案自首了，你现在应该很忙。","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你闯入的那所工坊属于深海主教奥卢斯，他在百年以前就来到了伊比利亚，还参与过雷亚-伊比利亚的设计。","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_whistle","volume":"1","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"（吹口哨）一条大鳞啊。","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"那你怎么还愁眉苦脸的？","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"岛民的问题比我想象中更严重，而且奥卢斯的计划绝没那么简单。","id":417},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"说到这个，我给你带了一件礼物。","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"海嗣的尸体？","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"碎成这样还能认出来啊？","id":424},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_formal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":425,"musicid":6},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"如果你曾在阿戈尔的军团服役，你也会掌握这项技能。","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"小帮手，分析海嗣成分。","id":429},{"type":"dialog","id":430},{"type":"charslot","id":431},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_activation","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1401_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"正在检测……","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"基质结构与同种的其他海嗣完全一致，但神经系统的架构存在显著差异，神经信号的传递逻辑完全不同于……","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"新型海嗣……","id":437},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_microrobot","volume":"1","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1401_1#1$1","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"提示，该生物的综合成分曾有过识别记录。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"什么？小帮手，分析比对。","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1401_1#1$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"正在分析……曾识别到纳乔携带相关成分。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"……","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#10$1","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"欸，能不能翻译一下，它在说些什么？","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"这是一种新型特殊海嗣，它的底层生理机制被人修改了，纳乔与这种特殊海嗣有过接触，还有……","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"或许我知道奥卢斯究竟想做什么了。","id":452},{"type":"dialog","id":453},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":454},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":455},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":456},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":457},{"type":"charslot","id":458},{"type":"background","id":459},{"type":"image","id":460}],"characters":["惩戒军士官","克莱门莎","？？？","塔西塔","纳乔","斐戴拉","洒脱的船工","萨尔瓦多","特菲","瓦列里奥","惩戒军士兵","德鲁莎","南多","小帮手"]}